{"schema_version":1,"id":"d59f2q7ox43l","type":"work","title":"通占大象曆星經","authors":[],"indexed_by":[{"source":"欽定四庫全書總目","source_bid":"d59dh3vo9af4","title_info":"《通占大象曆星經》•六卷","author_info":"不著撰人名氏","summary":"不著撰人名氏。首題原闕文一張，書末亦有脫佚，每卷第一行有姜七、薑八等字，用千字文記數，蓋道藏殘本也。大抵每星為圖，而附以占說，有宋、汴、蔡、幽諸州名，似是唐人之詞。始於紫微垣之四輔，由角、亢曆二十八舍，至壁宿而止。然多舛誤，次第亦顛倒不倫，蓋已為傳抄者所竄亂矣。","edition":"浙江范懋柱家天一閣藏本"}],"juan_count":{"number":6},"resources":[{"id":"wikisource","name":"维基文库","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/通占大象曆星經","types":["text"]},{"id":"shidianguji-jiajingzhihuanguanke","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/HY7086","metadata":{"edition":"嘉靖祗洹館刻本","version":"v7","total_page":86,"paragraph_count":139,"has_translation":true,"check_type":"粗校"},"types":["text","image"]},{"id":"shidianguji-shanghaihanfenlouyin","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/DZ0287","metadata":{"edition":"上海涵芬樓影印明《正統道藏》本","version":"v5","total_page":108,"paragraph_count":193,"check_type":"粗校"},"types":["text","image"]},{"id":"shidianguji-wanliershixinancheng","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/HY6474","metadata":{"edition":"萬曆二十年(1592)新安程氏刻本","version":"v3","total_page":88,"paragraph_count":687,"has_translation":true,"check_type":"粗校"},"types":["text","image"]}],"measures":[{"unit":"卷","number":6}],"measure_info":"六卷","updated_at":"2026-05-17T16:27:21-07:00","_has_text":true,"_has_image":true,"period_upper":"qing","period_upper_basis":"catalog_bound：所繫諸志中最緊者為《欽定四庫全書總目》（清紀昀等（1782）），故不晚於 qing","period":"sui-tang","period_basis":"《欽定四庫全書總目》提要斷為唐人所撰（「則必唐人」「是唐末人」「似是唐人」「所記皆唐代雜事」）","ai_note":"2026-08-25 斷代（無斷代條目整理，shard 2）：period 定為 sui-tang。《欽定四庫全書總目》提要斷為唐人所撰（「則必唐人」「是唐末人」「似是唐人」「所記皆唐代雜事」）","revision":"1.0.0","revised_at":"2026-08-25","has_text":true,"has_image":true,"_path":"Work/4/3/l/d59f2q7ox43l-通占大象曆星經.json","_isDraft":false}